 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, use this scenario: The Nice Cab Company charges a flat rate of $3.00 for each fare, plus $1.70 per mile. A competing taxi service, the Enjoyable Cab Company, charges a flat rate of $5.00 for each fare, plus $1.60 per mile.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 507868,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Using the variable <span data-math=\"x\">x</span> for number of miles, write the equation that would allow you to find the total fare <span data-math=\"(T)\">(T)</span> using the Nice Cab Company.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Break your words into components.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>The total fare</td>\n<td>is</td>\n<td>a flat fee of $3.00</td>\n<td>plus</td>\n<td>$1.70 per mile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i>T</i></td>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>1.7<i>x</i></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span data-math=\"T = 3 + 1.7x\"></span></p>\n<p>Alternate answer option: <span data-math=\"T = 1.7x + 3\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"{{T}} = 1.7x + 3\">T = 1.7x + 3</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 507869,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "It is 22 miles from the airport to your hotel. What would be your total fare using the Nice Cab Company?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Substitute 22 for <i>x</i> in the equation <span data-math=\"T = 3+1.7x\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"T = 3 + 1.7(22) = 3 + 37.4 = 40.4\"></span></p>\n<p>The ride from the airport to the hotel costs $40.40.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "$40.40"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 507870,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Using the variable <span data-math=\"y\">y</span> for number of miles, write the equation that would allow you to find the total fare <span data-math=\"(T)\">(T)</span> using the Enjoyable Cab Company.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Break your words into components.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>The total fare</td>\n<td>is</td>\n<td>a flat fee of $5.00</td>\n<td>plus</td>\n<td>$1.60 per mile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i>T</i></td>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>1.6<i>y</i></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span data-math=\"T = 5 + 1.6y\"></span></p>\n<p>Alternate answer option: <span data-math=\"T = 1.6y + 5\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"{{T}} = 1.6y + 5\">T = 1.6y + 5</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 507871,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Using the same 22-mile trip from the airport to the hotel, how much would the total fare be for using the Enjoyable Cab Company?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Substitute 22 for <i>y</i> in the equation <span data-math=\"T = 5 + 1.6y\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"T = 5 + 1.6(22) = 5 + 35.2 = 40.2\"></span></p>\n<p>The ride from the airport to the hotel costs $40.20.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "$40.20"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 507872,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Based on the cost of each cab ride, which cab company should you use for the trip from the airport to the hotel? Why?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The Enjoyable Cab Company costs $40.20, while the Nice Cab Company costs 20 cents more at $40.40. You should use the Enjoyable Cab Company.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"40.40 – 40.20 = 0.20\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "The Enjoyable Cab Company, because the cab fare will be $ 0.20 less than what it would cost to take a taxi from the Nice Cab Company."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
